#. module: split_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:split_website.project_charcoal_swordsman
msgid ""
"A human of nearly 25 cycles. She is the captain of a ship she inherited "
"from her deceased uncle and shelters Adapak at the beginning of his "
"journey, helping him travel to the island of Caspama. A woman of strong "
"personality, she uses it to disguise her own insecurities. Sirara is one "
"of the only mortals to know Adapak's origin."
msgstr ""

#. module: split_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:split_website.project_charcoal_swordsman
msgid ""
"A kind and altruistic youth with white eyes and dark skin. Adapak wanders "
"the world of Kurgala, searching for a meaning to his own existence and "
"unraveling the mysteries that The Four That Are One hide from mortals. He "
"is a master of the Tibaul Circles, a martial art that lets him defend "
"himself from multiple opponents at once. Despite being extremely cultured "
"and skilled in combat, his innocence and inexperience in the mortal world "
"involuntarily involve him in conflict."
msgstr ""

#. module: split_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:split_website.project_bubu_and_the_little_owls
msgid ""
